values ('d0d4eb17-cc5b-5a8a-a54c-6952cc31dec4', 'wg3-informative-writing-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-informative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Our Public Library$q$, $q$(1) Our town has a library. (2) A public library is a building where people can borrow books for free. (3) To borrow books, you need a library card. (4) The card has a number that keeps track of the books you take home.

(5) Libraries have more than just books. (6) Many libraries lend movies, music, and magazines. (7) Some libraries have computers that anyone can use. (8) My favorite color is green.

(9) A librarian is a person whose job is to help visitors at the library. (10) Librarians can help you find a book on almost any topic. (11) Some librarians read stories aloud to young children.

(12) The library is a place for the whole community to learn and have fun.$q$, 'draft')
