values ('bbac4c3c-1edf-5109-abed-87c23eecda62', 'wg3-narrative-writing-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Bridge That Held$q$, $q$(1) Our teacher, Ms. Okafor, gave every group a challenge: build a bridge out of paper and tape. (2) The bridge had to hold ten pennies. (3) My partner, Diego, and I taped flat strips of paper across two books. (4) When we added the third penny, the bridge sagged and crashed to the desk. (5) Diego groaned, and I felt like giving up.

(6) Then I remembered a picture of a real bridge with zigzag shapes on its sides. (7) "What if we fold the paper back and forth like a fan?" I asked. (8) We tried it, and it worked better. (9) We built a new bridge with folded strips.

(10) One by one, we stacked the pennies on top. (11) Ms. Okafor counted out loud as the class watched. (12) The bridge held all ten pennies, plus five more!$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
