        '3-5', $q$Our Town Needs a Bike Path$q$, $q$(1) Many kids in Pine Hollow ride bikes to the park on weekends. (2) Our town should build a bike path along River Road. (3) Right now, bikes have to share the road with cars and trucks. (4) A bike path would keep riders safer because they would have their own space.

